      "pool": "fal",
      "training_on_uploads": false,
      "verified_on": "2026-09-29",
      "notes": "Pay per use; commercial rights per model badge (Commercial use vs Research only). MCP header Bearer ${FAL_KEY}; REST header Key <key>. Media kept >= 7 days, payloads 30 days; credits expire 365 days after purchase. Usage and billing-events APIs need an admin key (FAL_ADMIN_KEY), which never goes to agents."
    },
    "higgsfield": {
      "name": "Higgsfield",
      "access": ["mcp", "cli"],
      "mcp_server": "higgsfield",
      "auth": { "scheme": "oauth" },
      "pool": "higgsfield",
      "training_on_uploads": true,
      "no_native_cap": true,
      "watermark_plans": ["free"],
      "verified_on": "2026-09-29",
      "notes": "CLI @higgsfield/cli 1.1.26 (`higgsfield auth login`); generation MCP https://mcp.higgsfield.ai/mcp needs a paid plan; the Blender bridge is a different server. Commercial use on all plans; outputs may not train AI; Higgsfield may train on uploads below Enterprise. CLI JSON field names are [U]."
    },
    "meshy": {
      "name": "Meshy",
      "access": ["mcp", "rest"],
      "mcp_server": "meshy",
      "auth": { "scheme": "bearer", "env": "MESHY_API_KEY", "keyring": { "service": "game-studio-kit", "username": "MESHY_API_KEY" } },
      "base_url": "https://api.meshy.ai",
      "pool": "meshy",
      "training_on_uploads": true,
      "attribution_plans": ["free"],
      "verified_on": "2026-09-29",
      "notes": "API needs Pro (1,000 cr/mo, private ownership, 10 concurrent tasks). Free-plan output is CC BY 4.0. Failed tasks are not charged [C]. Results expire (expires_at): download at once."
    },
    "tripo": {
      "name": "Tripo",
      "access": ["rest"],
      "auth": { "scheme": "bearer", "env": "TRIPO_API_KEY", "keyring": { "service": "game-studio-kit", "username": "TRIPO_API_KEY" } },
      "base_url": "https://openapi.tripo3d.ai/v3",
      "pool": "tripo",
      "training_on_uploads": "unknown",
      "blocked_plans": ["free"],
      "verified_on": "2026-09-29",
      "notes": "v3 only (v2 is being shut down); assetgen refuses any other base or route. 1 credit = $0.01. Free-user outputs belong to Tripo (ToS 5.2.1). assetgen runs the free Rig Check (POST /v3/animations/rig-check, GLB only) before every paid rig and records credits_consumed as the actual. Task poll route GET /v3/tasks/<task_id> and the response field names are [U]: confirm with one paid run."
    },
    "scenario": {
      "name": "Scenario",
      "access": ["mcp"],
      "mcp_server": "scenario",
      "auth": { "scheme": "oauth" },
      "pool": "scenario",
      "training_on_uploads": "unknown",
      "blocked_plans": ["free"],
      "verified_on": "2026-09-29",
      "notes": "MCP https://mcp.scenario.com/mcp (OAuth). Starter and above: full commercial licence; Free: personal and evaluation only. Compute units are budgeted as credits. model_run with dry_run=true prices a call."
    },
